00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.436
- Thank you so much.

00:07:48.431 --> 00:07:51.181
- Yeah, I'm learning from you. So whatever you do out there, I'm 

00:07:51.175 --> 00:07:54.728
just gonna visualize it. These guys nice to you? They're respectful?

